Z||000029||FieroMaster88||08-27-2001||10:15 AM||||What would be the best suspension set up for my 88?  I was going to do poly all the way around, Koni adjustibles and the lowering springs from the fiero store...ooh yeah, and add the rear sway bar.  I was also lookin into doing some 17" rims....but will they fit after i lower it?<P>Your car looks sweet.  You do good work  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Any tmie you want to help me out you can  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>------------------<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">            <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe With a new V6<BR>5 speed Isuzu trans<BR>AcCel 8mm wires<BR>rapid fire plugs<BR>custom intake with K&N filter.<BR>Soon to be 2" closer to the ground and have a turbo||||reg||5
